Package: rlogger
Type: Package
Title: R Command Logger for Audit Purposes
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Ishmeet Singh", "HSA", email = "", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Automatically logs all R commands executed by users for audit and
    compliance purposes. Captures commands in real-time and stores them in JSONL
    format on a configurable storage location.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite (>= 1.7.0),
    uuid (>= 0.1-4)
